       <h2 id="faq">Questions we hear before a quote</h2>
 <h3>Should a moving site show prices?</h3><p>Show prices only when the rule is stable enough that the number on the site matches the number the coordinator quotes. Otherwise, collect the move details and price it properly. A wrong instant price creates the call you were trying to avoid.</p>
